ac{6 t^{2}+1}{-3}.\n$$\n\nAt the point where $t=1,$ the slope of the tangent line is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m & =\\frac{6 (1)^{2}+1}{-3}=\\frac{7}{-3}=-\\frac{7}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, to calculate the equation of the tangent line, we use point-slope form with the point $(x_1,y_1)=(2,3)$ and the slope $m=-\\frac{7}{3}.$ We get\n\n$$\ny-3=-\\frac{7}{3}(x-2).\n$$" 13194139535994 17592186045443 true] [17592186553840 1080 "y-3=\\frac{7}{3}(x-2)" 13194139535994 17592186045443 true] [17592186553840 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535994 17592186045443 true] [17592186553840 1083 #uuid "feb93165-8834-5d23-8cb1-cb349bcdd0ed" 13194139535994 17592186045443 true] [17592186553841 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186083244.py" 13194139535994 17592186045443 true] [17592186553841 1169 #uuid "3e710e4b-bb29-5c80-8867-309e329abe7c" 13194139535994 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"02127cc3-5af8-5028-af65-03c30e9fe0c4" 17592186553806 "047526f7-0fc2-546c-96a9-bb524e5db98c" 17592186553807 "0ab7b7c5-34e3-5ad2-846b-83d04db15199" 17592186553808 "156d3ad5-139f-5ce1-be31-d15bc1d7bc46" 17592186553809 "284cc5f1-30ca-5d6d-8545-526f35b4066d" 17592186553810 "2ece599e-7211-53e4-b852-c09c4aef59f8" 17592186553811 "32d5c050-22c0-5c3b-b3e9-4b293311efae" 17592186553812 "381d922a-2cd7-5c37-84dd-ff625781507d" 17592186553813 "3e91180b-6331-59e6-b109-17873fdcd979" 17592186553814 "42a51268-246f-58ac-af6a-cf3f33fa395d" 17592186553815 "5072b8c8-db19-54cc-aab6-49d577cbbf16" 17592186553816 "5205a794-1a72-5a43-aeec-856be7dfeb5c" 17592186553817 "53047d7f-e530-5d0a-aba3-c4a05ecabb3b" 17592186553818 "54fcf7fa-29a1-50a6-8a2b-f8e763435745" 17592186553819 "584a63db-59f3-5c89-94e7-c2d1bdc0d843" 17592186553820 "598ab248-3cae-524c-9fc7-76f8b1fd9414" 17592186553821 "5f42491a-9739-5bf3-8c90-e0807021a26c" 17592186553822 "631a8bbe-eb86-5a24-9088-75cad1180129" 17592186553823 "82675b58-ae0e-59ed-a375-557f1aa20546" 17592186553824 "8479a10a-7f66-540d-8458-dda374fac829" 17592186553825 "8a92aeb3-1beb-54cc-b477